cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CVXlab in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CVXlab"
abstract: >-
  CVXlab is an open-source Python laboratory for modeling and solving convex
  optimization problems. It extends CVXPY with user-friendly interfaces,
  integrated SQLite-backed data management, and support for multiple,
  interconnected optimization models defined via Excel or YAML configuration files.
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-05"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/cvxlab/cvxlab"
url: "https://cvxlab.readthedocs.io"
doi: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20644006
keywords:
  - convex optimization
  - mathematical programming
  - algebraic modeling
  - cvxpy
  - Python
  - energy systems
  - operations research
